{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達（NVIDIA）今日宣佈，黃仁勳（Jensen Huang）自即日起恢復擔任公司總裁兼行政總裁，並重新出任董事會成員。董事會一致投票通過這一決定，認為黃仁勳具備坦誠溝通和領導英偉達的能力，其復職符合公司股東、員工、合作夥伴及客户的最佳利益。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587684.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:15:30.147096+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:02:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:08:50.342228+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:08:50.342228+00:00","content_hash":"397234b106687d0b2a12a4b683cf671909a071693746e9dae0f3b436183ed4f9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}